        <details class="sql-syntax-ref">
            <summary><i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i> Reference pattern — SELECT and FROM</summary>
            <div class="sql-syntax-body">
                <pre><code>-- Every column from one table
SELECT *
FROM table_name;

-- Only the columns you need
SELECT column_a, column_b
FROM table_name;

-- Rename a column in the result set
SELECT column_a AS useful_label
FROM table_name;</code></pre>
                <p><code>SELECT</code> chooses the columns to return. <code>FROM</code> chooses the table those columns come from.</p>
            </div>
        </details>

